# Mercenary, so an outlaw, CR 700.12) on turn three. The trigger goes above the Desperado (two on the stack), resolves and makes a copy
# (CR 707.10) that is not cast, so it triggers nothing: the copy resolves first (the Desperado is still on the stack, Bot1 has
